				<textElement textAlignment="Left">
					<font size="15" isBold="false"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[WHEREAS the said owner has agreed to let Level-4, Room No. 115/116 (BS Bhaban), measuring more or less 639 sq. ft., situated on the 4th floor of the aforesaid Municipal Holding No. 75-76, Laboratory Road, P.S. New Market, Dhaka-1205. The Tenant has agreed to take the aforesaid room on a monthly rental basis on the terms and conditions hereinafter mentioned and contained.
]]></text>
