				</reportElement>
				<textElement textAlignment="Left">
					<font size="15" isBold="false"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[1. That the rent of the aforesaid room shall be Tk. 32,000/- (Thirty-Two Thousand Taka) only, and the tenancy is to commence on and from 1st October 2025 to 30th September 2028 and shall be for a period of 3 (Three) years, which may be extended further by mutual consent.
]]></text>
